  c. you provide the complete, editable source for the covered Software you
     distribute, with necessary build instructions, without an additional fee;
  d. you satisfy section 4 for your Modifications; and
  e. you do not impose additional terms or technical restrictions that prevent
     recipients from exercising the permissions expressly granted here.

Each recipient receives the Licensor's permissions directly under this license,
subject to its terms. For your original Modifications included in a distributed
copy, you offer each recipient the same permissions under these same terms.
Recipients who make further Modifications have their own obligations to
contribute those changes to the Original Project.

You may not replace this license with another license for the Licensor's code.
The broader contribution rights granted to the Licensor by section 5 do not
give you the same right to commercially license the combined Software.

